-| --- | --- | --- | --- |
-| Awkward/unnatural wording | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
-| Excessive/flowery wording | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
-| Vague/empty wording | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
-| Unnecessary wording | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
